---------------------------------------

Initially, when we open Prometheus Targets, worker nodes may show DOWN.

This happens if Prometheus cannot resolve the worker hostnames or connect to Node Exporter.

On the monitoring server, edit:

sudo vi /etc/hosts

Add worker node private IP addresses:

13.127.130.98 worker-1
3.6.41.159 worker-2

IMPORTANT:
Replace these example IP addresses with your actual worker node private IP addresses.

Check the configuration:

cat /etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml

Make sure worker-1 and worker-2 are configured as scrape targets.


